=== Module 04 - Context-Free Grammars ===

grammar: fixtures/balanced.grammar
  nonterminals: S
  terminals   : ( )
  start       : S
  productions :
    (0) S -> ( S ) S
    (1) S -> epsilon

leftmost derivation of ( ) ( )  [choices: 0 1 0 1 1]
    S
=>  ( S ) S         (0) S -> ( S ) S
=>  ( ) S           (1) S -> epsilon
=>  ( ) ( S ) S     (0) S -> ( S ) S
=>  ( ) ( ) S       (1) S -> epsilon
=>  ( ) ( )         (1) S -> epsilon
    6 sentential forms, 5 steps

language up to length 6:
    len 0: epsilon
    len 2: ( )
    len 4: ( ( ) )
  |  ( ) ( )
    len 6: ( ( ( ) ) )
  |  ( ( ) ( ) )
  |  ( ( ) ) ( )
  |  ( ) ( ( ) )
  |  ( ) ( ) ( )
    9 strings of length <= 6 -- raise the bound and the list always grows (the grammar is infinite)

membership (bounded derivation search):
    ( )           DERIVABLE      (S =>* ( ) in 3 steps)
    ( ( ) )       DERIVABLE      (S =>* ( ( ) ) in 5 steps)
    ( ) )         NOT DERIVABLE  (searched every sentential form with <= 3 terminal symbols)
    ""            DERIVABLE      (S =>* "" in 1 step)

summary: productions=2  language=infinite  testsDerivable=3/4
